1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,749
That knight on g four is hanging for a reason.

2
00:00:03,829 --> 00:00:07,577
The Ruy Lopez gives White a fast and natural setup.

3
00:00:07,657 --> 00:00:11,406
Black places the knight where a pawn can chase it.

4
00:00:11,486 --> 00:00:15,234
White opens the center while the king castles safely.

5
00:00:15,314 --> 00:00:19,063
The h pawn pushes, and the fishing pole is set.

6
00:00:19,143 --> 00:00:22,891
White takes the bait and opens the g file.

7
00:00:22,971 --> 00:00:26,720
The queen arrives with an attack that matters more than material.
